{"unit_id": "tag:01O8:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n看来我们在某处可能需要下面的引理（lemma）。\n情形如下：\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> 设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 设<MATH_0002>为拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）分次（graded）<MATH_0003>-代数（algebra）。\n<STRUCT_0005> 用<MATH_0004>表示<MATH_0005>上的相对齐次谱（relative homogeneous spectrum）。\n<STRUCT_0006> 设<MATH_0006>为概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0007> 设<MATH_0007>为可逆（invertible）<MATH_0008>-模（module）。\n<STRUCT_0008> 设<MATH_0009>为分次（graded）<MATH_0010>-代数（algebras）的同态（homomorphism）。\n<STRUCT_0009>\n给定上述数据，置（set）\n<MATH_0011>\n其中<MATH_0012>满足下列条件：\n<STRUCT_0010>\n<STRUCT_0011> <MATH_0013>为仿射开集（affine open），\n<STRUCT_0012> <MATH_0014>，且\n<STRUCT_0013> <MATH_0015>为齐次的（homogeneous）。\n<STRUCT_0014>\n也就是说，此时<MATH_0016>，而<MATH_0017>是相应的开集（open）（见模（Modules）一章的引理（Lemma）<REF_0001>）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "relative homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "相对齐次谱"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "置"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次的"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "指下文可能用到的辅助命题。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指相对齐次谱的基底。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "修饰分次代数。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "说明所给代数带有分次。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指定义相对齐次谱所用的代数。"}, {"source_term": "relative homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "相对齐次谱", "context": "指基底上的相对 Proj。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指态射两端的对象。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指概形之间给定的箭头。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "修饰所给的模。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指所给的可逆模。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰同态两端的代数。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指同态两端的分次对象。"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态", "context": "指分次代数的同态。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "置", "context": "在给定数据后引入所定义的对象。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "列出定义中对开集的仿射性要求。"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次的", "context": "说明所取元素的齐次性。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "指与所给数据对应的开集。"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "引文中的章节名。"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "章节引文中被引用的命题类型。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01O9:statement", "translation": "沿用上述假设与记号（notation）。态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0001>在<MATH_0002>上的概形（schemes）之间诱导出一个典范态射（canonical morphism）\n<MATH_0003>，\n以及一个分次（graded）<MATH_0004>-代数（algebras）的映射（map）\n<MATH_0005>。\n二者由下列性质刻画：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 对每个开集（open）<MATH_0006>和每个<MATH_0007>，图表（diagram）\n<MATH_0008>\n是交换的（commutative）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 对任意<MATH_0009>和任意开子概形（open subscheme）<MATH_0010>，若<MATH_0011>为满射（surjective），则态射（morphism）<MATH_0012>的限制（restriction）与态射（morphism）<MATH_0013>一致。后者的存在性由相对齐次谱（relative homogeneous spectrum）的构造保证，见定义（Definition）<REF_0001>。\n<STRUCT_0004> 对任意仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0014>，限制（restriction）\n<MATH_0015>\n经由<MATH_0016>（见引理（Lemma）<REF_0002>）与三元组（triple）\n<MATH_0017>\n一致。按引理（Lemma）<REF_0003>，后者对应于映射（map）\n<MATH_0018>，\n它由<MATH_0019>诱导。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "notation", "target_term": "记号"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换的"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "relative homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "相对齐次谱"}, {"source_term": "Definition", "target_term": "定义"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "notation", "target_term": "记号", "context": "指前文采用的数学记号。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指诱导下述两个对象的给定态射。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指基底上典范态射两端的对象。"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "指由给定态射典范诱导出的态射。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰诱导映射两端的代数。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指诱导映射两端的分次对象。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指随典范态射一同诱导出的分次代数映射。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "指第一项中任取的开集。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "指第一项中由箭头组成的图表。"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换的", "context": "陈述图表的交换性。"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "指第二项中满足满射条件的子概形。"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "陈述第二项对所给箭头的满射性条件。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指第二项中取限制的态射。"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "指第二项中对态射所作的限制。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指相对齐次谱的构造所给的态射。"}, {"source_term": "relative homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "相对齐次谱", "context": "其构造保证第二项所比较的态射存在。"}, {"source_term": "Definition", "target_term": "定义", "context": "指给出相对齐次谱构造的定义。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指第三项中任取的仿射开集。"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "指第三项中在仿射开集上的限制。"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "指说明第三项中所用识别的引理。"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组", "context": "指第三项中与限制比较的三元组。"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "指第三项中给出三元组的引理。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指第三项中与三元组对应的诱导映射。"}], "notes": []}
